House Proposal of Amendment
S. 179
An act relating to the Uniform Disclaimer of Property Interests Act
The House proposes to the Senate to amend the bill in Sec. 1, 14 V.S.A.
chapter 129, in subsection 4105(c), after the word “minor” by inserting the
word “child”

